                                                "sense_id": "e1e74cce-160c-3775-90ae-613bcf24f4da",
                                                "text": "And nowe lorde beholde their threatenyngꝭ / and graunte vnto thy ſervauntꝭ wyth all confydence to ſpeake thy worde."
                                            },
